  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This set of dull metallic handcuffs have faint runes which trace the chains and cuffs. They respond to the presence of magic by releasing a powerful electric current.</p> <p>If these cuffs are used to bind a creature, and the creature casts a spell using vocal, somatic, or material components,the cuffs shock the creature for 8d8 lightning damage, and the creature must succeed on a DC 18 Constitution saving throw to see if they can continue casting the spell. A creature reduced to 0 hit points by this damage is stable.</p>",
